; /var/lib/bind/db.teamNN.example: zone teamNN.example, team NN (Module 2, Lab 2.1).
; Set the team number with sed (Lab 2.1 step 2) and put your VM 1 address
; from the lab sheet on the ns1 line. Lab TTLs stay at 60 seconds or less:
; you can watch changes arrive, and the workshop plan's lab signing policy
; for Module 7 (max-zone-ttl 60) rejects a zone with a longer TTL.
$TTL 60
@       IN SOA  ns1.teamNN.example. hostmaster.teamNN.example. (
                2026102701 ; serial: YYYYMMDDnn; raise it on every change
                3600       ; refresh: 1 hour
                600        ; retry: 10 minutes
                1209600    ; expire: 2 weeks
                60 )       ; negative caching TTL: 1 minute
        IN NS   ns1.teamNN.example.
ns1     IN A    192.0.2.30

; Lab 2.1: add your records below this line.
